{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need An Army is a Roguelike Slotsbuilder.  Spin, arrange, and lock in to crush your enemies. Collect relics, match patterns, and autobattle your way to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and upgrade powerful units and relics</strong> to crush your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle with your grid\u00a0</strong>- Randomize the board, line up the bonuses, then lock in to unleash your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a new map</strong>\u00a0<strong>each time</strong> - discover random events, mini games, and fight with no two runs being the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/562b18fffd000f7a20bb839ba670ceb9.avif?t=1766691884\" width=860 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/e5bb1cfb06b2b47afce0551ad8433568.poster.avif?t=1766691884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/e5bb1cfb06b2b47afce0551ad8433568.webm?t=1766691884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/e5bb1cfb06b2b47afce0551ad8433568.mp4?t=1766691884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a commander and customize your army!\u00a0 Specialize in defense, offense, gold, or whatever you'd like! Each faction has over 10 units to choose from - try mixing dwarves and undead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/a867d9899f9e87df5888b0512ab88940.avif?t=1766691884\" width=860 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/f609cd6e2748edefe98a244072371209.poster.avif?t=1766691884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/f609cd6e2748edefe98a244072371209.webm?t=1766691884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/f609cd6e2748edefe98a244072371209.mp4?t=1766691884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align the grid to find the best bonuses, then unleash your army on your enemies!\u00a0 Focus on matching class patterns, bonus tiles, or whatever you need on a given turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/3f0b8e43784cd434167add03d6245041.avif?t=1766691884\" width=860 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/a598f881533397c645e429773553fd9e.poster.avif?t=1766691884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671320/extras/a598f881533397c645e429773553fd9e.webm?t=1766691884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://